                "retweet_count": 72,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Speaker Johnson said Trump & his Republicans are \u201chaving fun\u201d during the shutdown. All while: \n\n\u274c 326,268 Virginians are at risk of losing health care\n\u274c 19,000 VA-11 families are facing skyrocketing premiums\n\nRepublicans need to do their jobs.",
