                "text": "This guy voted to take health care coverage from 23,229 of his constituents and is on vacation while a family earning $64k/yr in his district is about to see their premiums skyrocket $2500/yr. \n\nYou golfing, hunting, or sunbathing next week @timburchett? All three?",
