                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I visited Elden Street Tea Shop in Reston to learn how the healthcare crisis will impact this small business. \n\nWe heard from a mother whose adult child will lose Medicaid coverage because of the looming cuts and a part-time employee and college student who can\u2019t afford the skyrocketing ACA premiums that will hit if Congress fails to act. \n\nIt\u2019s past time for Republicans to show up to work and negotiate to cancel the health care cuts and reopen the government.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
