                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Fairfax families are opening their mail to find health premiums skyrocketing \u2014 all because Republicans are letting ACA tax credits expire.\n\nI\u2019m working around the clock with my Democratic colleagues to stop these hikes and end the shutdown.\n\nIf your family is being hit by this health care crisis, please share your story. Your voices help me fight to make care affordable.\n\nhttps://t.co/kAsni41sVa",
