                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump and Republicans are so dead set on letting health care premiums skyrocket that they were willing to shut down the government. \n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting for Fairfax families $ pushing for a bipartisan deal to fund the govt, protect federal workers, & prevent this health care crisis. It\u2019s time for Republicans to get back to work.",
